## Project Description
EcoTrack is a web-based carbon footprint tracker that helps 
users monitor their daily CO2 emissions from transport, energy, 
food, and consumption. It provides personalised eco tips and 
tracks progress over time, directly supporting UN SDG 13: 
Climate Action.

## Target Users
University students and young adults who want to understand 
and reduce their environmental impact.

## SDLC Overview
- **Planning:** Defined project scope, user stories, product backlog on Trello
- **Design:** Created Use Case Diagram, Class Diagram, UI mockups
- **Development:** Built HTML/CSS/JS prototype over 2 sprints
- **Testing:** Conducted user testing and bug fixes

## Tools Used
